{"id":"fhb738ozlyws85jkd6npzx771","title":"智商、科研成就与成长条件","originalTitle":null,"summary":"智商虽对科研至关重要，但并非决定性因素。科研成果由认知能力、知识积累、选题方向、平台资源等多因素共同决定。高智商者在不同科研领域和平台中表现差异显著，且需长期专注投入才能取得重大突破。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"科学网博客"},"links":{"original":"http://blog.sciencenet.cn/home.php?mod=space&uid=3234816&do=blog&id=1561197"},"publishedAt":null,"discoveredAt":"2026-11-15T01:56:40.305Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-15T01:56:40.305Z","category":null,"tags":["研究成果"],"score":26,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":null,"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":null,"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}